W","text":"まじか","ts":"1630239434.129900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P+e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"86874c05-702e-4f38-a35f-432f9312a1d9","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/mph_for_doctors/status/1431952670609186820\u003e","ts":"1630239415.129700","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/mph_for_doctors|@mph_for_doctors\u003e: すみません、これ完全に勘違いしていました。\n\n最初に問題となった「埼玉県のバイアル」の情報ではありません。\n\nあくまで、続報で出てきた「沖縄県のバイアル」に対してのみの情報です。\n\n誤解を招いた方は誠に申し訳ありませんでした。\n\n当該ツイート削除します。 \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E99RXHhUUAIE5w-.jpg\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"手を洗う救急医Taka（木下喬弘）","author_subname":"@mph_for_doctors","author_link":"https://twitter.com/mph_for_doctors/status/1431952670609186820","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1292486160548352000/qvMWK3Sl_normal.jpg","text":"すみません、これ完全に勘違いしていました。\n\n最初に問題となった「埼玉県のバイアル」の情報ではありません。\n\nあくまで、続報で出てきた「沖縄県のバイアル」に対してのみの情報です。\n\n誤解を招いた方は誠に申し訳ありませんでした。\n\n当該ツイート削除します。 \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E99RXHhUUAIE5w-.jpg\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/E99RXHhUUAIE5w-.jpg","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1630239095,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/mph_for_doctors/status/1431952670609186820","original_url":"https://twitter.com/mph_for_doctors/status/1431952670609186820"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d54cB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e86cf099-733a-4c66-810c-d05c13720554","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"よかったよかった、か?","ts":"1630237145.129500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DJ9G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"baacfa3a-b8d5-41a5-8957-81eab27f0716","type":"message","user":"U76V658V6","text":"興味深いですね。","ts":"1630235768.129000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HdPwB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3ef019b0-9050-4b30-bd34-ea76c13b4649","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"逆に寄生しないと生きられない細菌もなくはなく、とかね","ts":"1630235714.128700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4MDE2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"49a180d0-f36b-4b22-b337-0b15f6b61a70","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://srad.jp/~phason/journal/643784/\u003e\n\u0026gt; これら巨大ウィルスは，単体での増殖こそできないものの，非常に多くの働きをするタンパク質がコードされており，ゲノムサイズ的にも一般的な細菌などと遜色がない．ゲノムの中には代謝に関わるタンパク質の遺伝子やアミノ酸合成にかかわる遺伝子などもコードされており，部分的とはいえ「生命」の定義としてよく用いられる「代謝」に自身がかかわるなど，一般的なウィルスとは異なる面が有る（これらの遺伝子が独自に発達したものなのか，宿主からたまたま拝借して取り込まれているものなのかはよくわかっていない）","ts":"1630235693.128100","attachments":[{"fallback":"緑藻類において広範囲に見出された，巨大ウィルスの内在化 | phasonの日記 | スラド","id":1,"title":"緑藻類において広範囲に見出された，巨大ウィルスの内在化 | phasonの日記 | スラド","title_link":"https://srad.jp/~phason/journal/643784/","text":"\"Widespread endogenization of giant viruses shapes genomes of green algae\"M. Moniruzzaman, A. R. Weinheimer, C. A. Martinez-Gutierrez and F. O. Aylward, Nature, 588, 141-145 (2020). 関連する部分を調べていたら，本論より長くなるというある意味本末転倒．いや，やっぱりウィルス周りは面白いですね．...","thumb_url":"https://srad.jp/static/topics/journal_64.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"srad.jp","service_icon":"https://srad.jp/static/favicon.ico","thumb_width":64,"thumb_height":64,"from_url":"https://srad.jp/~phason/journal/643784/","original_url":"https://srad.jp/~phason/journal/643784/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=Uw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b5d39daf-6252-40c8-8f43-de5138c9b68b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"でも生命かの境界はあいまいなので難しいですねw、まあでもこわさわかる","ts":"1630235646.127700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7I3B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"27231d5f-2651-42aa-b35d-256aa45fd8c8","type":"message","user":"U76V658V6","text":"ウイルスの怖いところはそもそも生物じゃなく、ただひたすらに機械的に感染を広げていくってところかなぁ。","ts":"1630235586.126900","edited":{"user":"U76V658V6","ts":"1630235656.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1uHS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"17fda3ed-4d43-4f04-8c71-f68351b16f7b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"感染のタイプごとにけっこう対応の差が必要なのと、いろいろ文化とか宗教のしがらみがあるのもつらいねえ\n(エボラ出血熱のときは、死者を近親者が運んで埋葬の習慣が問題だったらしい)\nエボラは死亡率が高いがゆえに抑えはなんとかなったと言えるんだけど...","ts":"1630227731.126000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2HK0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f07415ae-d774-48db-9892-9c53d1d83813","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"本当に1千万人に届きえた","ts":"1630227546.123900","edited":{"user":"UGXMRNBUM","ts":"1630227560.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H3st"}]},{"client_msg_id":"388c8b99-3954-45e3-ade8-a10f431bb826","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"現実になりましたねえ","ts":"1630227529.123500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nw/Bw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"76ad119e-0f58-4513-bebf-ad2e6c44841c","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"2015年","ts":"1630227526.123300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xuj1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"787986bb-be10-493b-8307-a87850ae8996","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"\u003chttps://www.ted.com/talks/bill_gates_the_next_outbreak_we_re_not_ready/transcript?language=ja\u003e","ts":"1630227471.122800","attachments":[{"fallback":"Transcript of \"もし次の疫病大流行（アウトブレイク）が来たら？私たちの準備はまだ出来ていない\"","id":1,"title":"Transcript of \"もし次の疫病大流行（アウトブレイク）が来たら？私たちの準備はまだ出来ていない\"","title_link":"https://www.ted.com/talks/bill_gates_the_next_outbreak_we_re_not_ready/transcript?language=ja","text":"TED Talk Subtitles and Transcript: 2014年、世界はエボラの恐ろしい更なるアウトブレイクを免れる事が出来ました。何千人もの自らの犠牲を惜しまない医療従事者達の努力により―そして、率直に言えば単にとても幸運だったお陰で。 事態を振り返って、私たちにはもっとやるべきだった事が分かっています。アウトブレイクのシナリオに沿った計画立案からワクチンの開発、そして医療従事者達のトレーニング―ビル・ゲイツは今こそがあらゆる最善の方法やアイデアを実現する時だと訴えます。 「パニックに陥る必要はありません―でも今、始めなければならないのです。」","image_url":"https://pi.tedcdn.com/r/pe.tedcdn.com/images/ted/2c60223169fd66d3962f9f3c354081824d2914c5_2880x1620.jpg?c=1050%2C550\u0026w=1050","blocks":null,"service_name":"TED Talks","service_icon":"https://pa.tedcdn.com/apple-touch-icon.png","from_url":"https://www.ted.com/talks/bill_gates_the_next_outbreak_we_re_not_ready/transcript?language=ja","original_url":"https://www.ted.com/talks/bill_gates_the_next_outbreak_we_re_not_ready/transcript?language=ja"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8mnM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"baef5319-bf34-4d5b-b06b-b3b5da3a373f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"伝染るまでは致命的じゃないから広がるし撲滅しずらいし\nウィルスそのものの症状としてじゃなく呼吸系とかのダメージになるから死亡率高め、だっけ(ここらへんのいい情報見たけどポインタロスト....)\nというか、この情報の元のを見たいけど到達できなくてもどかしい...","ts":"1630227324.121800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mGfO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5702e75-401e-4122-9c52-a28f2d1876c4","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"コレ、逆のパターンが怖いっすね。\n今回は現実の問題でひきこもれ！ネット使え！だったけど。\nネット使うな！死ぬぞ！が来た時我々は生きていけるのだろうか","ts":"1630227191.119600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U01J7703PFT","UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=Z=yp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2056acfb-efb1-4011-b012-46b6c5e4b761","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"引きこもりライフが推奨されるのは最高なんだけど原因が:shit:すぎる","ts":"1630227157.118900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ykKe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"abdf7dc3-5dfb-4d5a-9f5e-fcf008b9cac5","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"天然痘+スペイン風邪みたない状態ですからね(といってもワクチンやっても天然痘みたいに撲滅は無理だけど)","ts":"1630227142.118600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MNMB"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U02D2M2EY1X","text":"\u003c@U02D2M2EY1X\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1630227133.118200","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"fd084939-5e93-40f3-aaea-154abc2c6b4c","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"近代でここまで病原体が驚異になるとは全く想定してなかったですわ\n歴史上でのお話でしか無いくらいの感覚でしか無かった","ts":"1630227106.117600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UL6CFN8NR","U023H98P3N0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BTn4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"77edf7d8-9e77-4468-98b3-ee7f2792120e","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"ほんとに。ウイルスってものの広大さ含めて凄い敵だなあって思います","ts":"1630226942.116600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MA9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c32f0e15-ab67-40f6-9e89-4d1c177f953f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"寄生虫や細菌(これも耐性菌の問題あるけど)はかなり対応できてますからね...","ts":"1630226897.115800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5rmkj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e219b4d6-4ed8-4233-ba0b-08bcb6f50401","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"最強の病原体って感じがする。","ts":"1630226845.115100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lRycd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"12d3bde9-96f9-448d-9af5-b5ea3b51f732","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"やー。ウイルスってやつぁ人類にとって未だ持って最大の弱点ですね、","ts":"1630226835.114800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rLVQu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7db8449c-b81f-457a-832c-0ec649865bfa","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"「カゼの特効薬つくったらノーベル賞」なんてのがあったけど、それがほしかった....だなあ","ts":"1630226774.114100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UPuY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1bcddefe-04ca-45a9-b03c-1f6ee9c38729","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ある意味人類ががんばった公衆衛生と免疫の特性でいちばん面倒なところにジャストミートする感染\u0026amp;症状なんですよねえ","ts":"1630226708.113100","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1630226727.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VXlQ+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6160f09a-0f9c-4e62-b885-2e9bdeb59898","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"ワクチン打っても結局安心はまだ程遠いですしねぇ","ts":"1630226662.112200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cw2B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b9107bf-4c0c-493d-b0a2-75b06f49f0b4","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ主張はさておき、はよ安心(安全ではない)にはなりたい","ts":"1630226642.111900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cwgm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"df86fb03-c691-478b-9c8d-a46d0dd6a2d8","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"うちは親族一同全員終わりましたねぇ。\n九州の妹夫婦だけ反ワクチン唱えてるみたいだけど","ts":"1630226600.111500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"juu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cf34cd91-f208-4622-a067-3ed4d21ad0b4","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"10月末くらいに、アンケでどんなもんだったのか、実施状況をanonymoseで取ってみてもいいかもな、と思った。\nあんがいみんな2回目完了してるなあ(1回目まだ)","ts":"1630226558.110700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wt7hp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8046c4d1-0a80-4cef-9063-572fb94de3b0","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"熱は出ないけど、ひたすら体中が痛くて…","ts":"1630226517.109800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=2Jh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"27e049e4-7937-4c33-a7ee-5f04409a658a","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"僕は2回めの3日目が本当にキツかったですね。","ts":"1630226503.109300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7lqP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"13fbcaed-4e7a-4785-883b-acfde593b095","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"やはり正念場は2回目だ・・・！","ts":"1630224071.109000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/bd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ACB45F13-C2A9-4E9C-8571-C787AE96D317","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"2日目より3日目の方がひどくなることはないと思うので大丈夫そうですね。","ts":"1630217228.108200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"yossya","count":1,"users":["U01J7703PFT"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4cDl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c7fe3b92-ff01-41bf-bb10-7855b9f3e054","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"自分のファイザー1回目の場合だと\n現在22時間経過して具体的な副反応は打った腕の筋肉痛的な痛みぐらいですね。","ts":"1630216361.106200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dUBb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4abbf244-70de-4338-a0ae-4fd4abc6b801","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"一回目はたいしたことないという話だけど","ts":"1630215614.105000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FJf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ba763c3c-af18-4423-9634-56ee66232dd4","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"明日ワクチン打つので対策グッズを買いに行かなければ","ts":"1630215604.104700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FAHJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d3841019-9c28-4b05-8adf-93fa938b8f39","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"もしくはWEP以上は対応していないとか。これは性能の問題がありそう。","ts":"1630179297.104200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"b